*VERSION: 3.0
*WRITTEN_BY: openair-conformance
* Tests: the V values are reset at every AC. The second airspace uses DC without its own V X= (line 18). The third airspace uses DY without its own V W= (line 24). The values of the first airspace are not used. V W= in the first airspace has no DY (line 11).

AC D
AY CTR
AN Example CTR
AH 4500 FT AMSL
AL GND
V X=46:00:00N 014:00:00E
V W=4
DC 2.5
AC D
AY CTR
AN Example CTR 2
AH 4500 FT AMSL
AL GND
DC 5
AC D
AY CTR
AN Example CTR 3
AH 4500 FT AMSL
AL GND
DY 46:00:00N 014:00:00E
DY 46:00:00N 015:00:00E
